ve/checksum pairs and refuses differing published bytes. Existing v1.1.0 assets, versions and renderer behavior stay unchanged.\n\nLocal verification: 40 Python tests passed, Bash syntax and release workflow gates passed, documentation links and historical evidence/helper hashes validated. Historical logs remain byte-identical.\n\nBefore merge, require both packaging checks and the complete manual release workflow on this exact PR revision: Ubuntu shared/static/CommonMark/lint/consumers/benchmark, minimum-built binary lifecycle on both Qt runtimes, Arch metadata/payload/namcap/fresh pacman integrity/four consumers/temporary upgrade/removal, with upload skipped. Repeat all gates on the exact main merge commit and retain final evidence separately.\n\nArch uses current rolling repositories; each run records image/package identities and provenance rather than promising reproducible hashes. No release publication, asset upload, host package installation, AUR or protection changes.\n","changed_files":28,"closed_at":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lebedenko/qmarkdown/issues/9/comments","commits":2,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lebedenko/qmarkdown/pulls/9/commits","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:00:19Z","deletions":8,"diff_url":"https://github.com/lebedenko/qmarkdown/pull/9.diff","draft":false,"head":{"label":"lebedenko:build/arch-packaging-integration","ref":"build/arch-packaging-integration","repo":{"allow_auto_merge":false,"allow_forking":true,"allow_merge_commit":true,"allow_rebase_merge":true,"allow_squash_merge":true,"allow_update_branch":false,"archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lebedenko/qmarkdown/{archive_format}{/ref}","archived":false,"assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lebedenko/qmarkdown/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lebedenko/qmarkdown/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lebedenko/qmarkdown/branches{/branch}","clone_url":"https://github.com/lebede